WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.738
There is no universally best shape A fixed dashboard
matrix may

00:00:05.764 --> 00:00:11.439
be easier to read in wide form A trend chart usually
benefits from long

00:00:11.465 --> 00:00:16.966
form because the category and time dimensions stay
as values Choose

00:00:16.993 --> 00:00:20.203
the shape based on the next analytical or reporting
task
